UMPLOT REM 1047 03011                                                   PLOT0001
       ORG 0                                                            PLOT0002
       PGM              PROGRAM CARD                                    PLOT0003
       PZE END,0,0                                                      PLOT0004
       PZE                                                              PLOT0005
       BCD 1PLOT1                                                       PLOT0006
       PZE PLOT1                                                        PLOT0007
       BCD 1PLOT2                                                       PLOT0008
       PZE PLOT2                                                        PLOT0009
       BCD 1PLOT3                                                       PLOT0010
       PZE PLOT3                                                        PLOT0011
       BCD 1PLOT4                                                       PLOT0012
       PZE PLOT4                                                        PLOT0013
       BCD 1FPLOT4                                                      PLOT0014
       PZE FPLOT                                                        PLOT0015
       BCD 1OMIT                                                        PLOT0016
       PZE OMIT                                                         PLOT0017
       BCD 1PLTAPE                                                      PLOT0018
       PZE PLTAP                                                        PLOT0019
       REL                                                              PLOT0020
       ORG 0                                                            PLOT0021
       REM    PLOTTING SUBROUTINE.   WRITES GRAPH IMAGES ON DECIMAL TAPEPLOT0022
       REM    FOR SUBSEQUENT OFF-LINE PRINTING OR PUNCHING. TAPE NUMBER,PLOT0023
       REM    NUMBER OF COLUMNS PER LINE AND NUMBER OF LINES PER RECORD PLOT0024
       REM    (HIGH OR LOW SPEED PRINTING) ARE SET AT ASSEMBLY TIME.    PLOT0025
       REM    TAPE CAN BE SWITCHED DURING EXECUTION BY THE PLTAPE ENTRY.PLOT0026
       REM                                                              PLOT0027
       REM    UNIVERSITY OF MICHIGAN COMPUTING CENTER   FEBRUARY 15,1961PLOT0028
       REM    PROGRAMMERS - BRICE CARNAHAN, LARRY EVANS                 PLOT0029
       REM                                                              PLOT0030
       REM    FORTRAN OR MAD CALLING SEQUENCES ARE                      PLOT0031
       REM      CALL OR EXECUTE  PLOT1 (NSCALE,NH,SBH,NV,SBV)           PLOT0032
       REM      CALL OR EXECUTE  PLOT2 (IMAGE,XMAX,XMIN,YMAX,YMIN)      PLOT0033
       REM      CALL OR EXECUTE  PLOT3 (BCD,X,Y,NDATA)                  PLOT0034
       REM              EXECUTE  PLOT4.(NCHAR,LABEL)                    PLOT0035
       REM      CALL            FPLOT4 (NCHAR,NHABCDEF....)             PLOT0036
       REM      CALL OR EXECUTE  OMIT (ARG)                             PLOT0037
       REM      CALL OR EXECUTE PLTAPE (ARG)                            PLOT0038
       REM                                                              PLOT0039
       REM    PRESET THE FOLLOWING FIVE INSTRUCTIONS BEFORE ASSEMBLY    PLOT0040
OTAPE  EQU 6                 SET OUTPUT TAPE HERE                       PLOT0041
LNREC  EQU 1                 SET LINES PER OUTPUT RECORD                PLOT0042
COL    EQU 120               SET COLUMNS IN OUTPUT LINE                 PLOT0043
SPACS  EQU 6                 SET UNUSED SPACES AT RIGHT EDGE OF PAGE    PLOT0044
       REM                   OR CARD.  SPACS MUST BE AT LEAST 6         PLOT0045
CDIM   EQU 20                SET SIZE OF C REGION.  MUST BE COL/6 OR    PLOT0046
       REM                   2*LNREC+2 WHICHEVER IS LARGER.             PLOT0047
       REM    ALL NON-709 INSTRUCTIONS HAVE ..... IN COLUMNS 20-25      PLOT0048
       REM .............................................................PLOT0049
       REM         MAIN JOB OF PLOT1 IS TO EXAMINE ARGUMENTS AND PREPAREPLOT0050
       REM         SAMPLE GRIDLINE (DASH TO DASH-WORDS+1) AND SAMPLE    PLOT0051
       REM         NON-GRID LINE (BLANK TO BLANK-WORDS+1) FOR PLOT2     PLOT0052
PLOT1  SXD IR4,4        ENTRY TO PLOT1                                  PLOT0053
       SXD IR1,1        SAVE REGISTERS                                  PLOT0054
       SXD IR2,2                                                        PLOT0055
       CLA 1,4          SCALE FACTORS AND DECIMAL POINT POSITIONS       PLOT0056
       STA DELTA                                                        PLOT0057
       STA DELT                                                         PLOT0058
       STZ WRON1        WRON1 = 0      CLEAR ERROR FLAG, PLOT1          PLOT0059
       CLA ONE                                                          PLOT0060
       STO WRON3        WRON3 = 1      SET ERROR FLAG, MISSING PLOT2    PLOT0061
       CLA 2,4                                                          PLOT0062
       STA *+1                                                          PLOT0063
       CLA **           NH,  NUMBER OF HORIZONTAL GRID LINES            PLOT0064
       TSX FIX,2                                                        PLOT0065
       TZE ERR1         ZERO ARGUMENT ILLEGAL, ERROR RETURN             PLOT0066
       STO NH                                                           PLOT0067
       CLA 3,4                                                          PLOT0068
       STA *+1                                                          PLOT0069
       CLA **           SBH, NUMBER OF SPACES BETWEEN HORIZ GRID LINES  PLOT0070
       TSX FIX,2                                                        PLOT0071
       TZE ERR1         ZERO ARGUMENT ILLEGAL, ERROR RETURN             PLOT0072
       STO SBH                                                          PLOT0073
       LDQ SBH                                                          PLOT0074
       MPY NH                                                           PLOT0075
       STQ LINES        LINES = NH*SBH      MAXIMUM LINE INDEX          PLOT0076
       CLA 4,4                                                          PLOT0077
       STA *+1                                                          PLOT0078
       CLA **           NV,  NUMBER OF VERTICAL GRID LINES              PLOT0079
       TSX FIX,2                                                        PLOT0080
       TZE ERR1         ZERO ARGUMENT ILLEGAL, ERROR RETURN             PLOT0081
       STO NV                                                           PLOT0082
       CLA 5,4                                                          PLOT0083
       STA *+1                                                          PLOT0084
       CLA **           SBV, NUMBER OF SPACES BETWEEN VERT GRID LINES   PLOT0085
       TSX FIX,2                                                        PLOT0086
       TZE ERR1         ZERO ARGUMENT ILLEGAL, ERROR RETURN             PLOT0087
       STO SBV                                                          PLOT0088
       LDQ SBV                                                          PLOT0089
       MPY NV                                                           PLOT0090
       STQ TOT          TOT = SBV*NV        MAXIMUM COLUMN INDEX        PLOT0091
       LLS 35                                                           PLOT0092
       ADD ONE                                                          PLOT0093
       STO TOTAL        TOTAL = TOT + 1     TOTAL COLUMNS PER LINE      PLOT0094
       SUB GWID         WHENEVER TOTAL .G. GRAPH WIDTH, ERROR RETURN    PLOT0095
       TMI PASS                                                         PLOT0096
ERR1   CLA FPONE        RETURN ONE, UNSUCCESSFUL PLOT1                  PLOT0097
       STO WRON1        WRON1 = 1      SET ERROR FLAG, PLOT1            PLOT0098
       WTD OTAPE   .....                                                PLOT0099
       CPY ER1     .....WRITE COMMENT  PLOT1                            PLOT0100
IR22   TXL WRITE,0,**                                                   PLOT0101
PASS   CLA TOTAL                                                        PLOT0102
       TSX FLOAT,2                                                      PLOT0103
       FDP SIXF                                                         PLOT0104
       STQ TEMP                                                         PLOT0105
       CLA TEMP                                                         PLOT0106
       FAD N999                                                         PLOT0107
       TSX FIX1,2                                                       PLOT0108
       STO WORDS        WORDS = TOTAL/6. ROUNDED UP TO NEAREST INTEGER  PLOT0109
       LDQ WORDS        WORDS, NUMBER OF MACHINE LOCATIONS PER LINE     PLOT0110
       MPY SIX                                                          PLOT0111
       STQ TOTLS        TOTLS = WORDS*6     BCD CHARACTERS PER LINE     PLOT0112
       LXA WORDS,2                                                      PLOT0113
       CLA TOTLS                                                        PLOT0114
       SUB TOTAL                                                        PLOT0115
       PAX 0,1                                                          PLOT0116
       CLA DSH,1        LAST WORD OF A HORIZONTAL GRID LINE             PLOT0117
       STO DASH+1,2     SET UP LAST WORD IN HORIZONTAL GRID LINE IMAGE  PLOT0118
       LDQ BLNKK        LAST WORD OF NON GRID LINE                      PLOT0119
       STQ BLANK+1,2    SET UP LAST WORD IN NON GRID LINE IMAGE         PLOT0120
       TIX *+2,2,1                                                      PLOT0121
       TXL *+5,0,       ONE WORD PER LINE CASE                          PLOT0122
       CLA DSH                                                          PLOT0123
       STO DASH+1,2     SET UP REMAINDER OF HORIZONTAL GRID LINE IMAGE  PLOT0124
       STQ BLANK+1,2    SET UP REMAINDER OF NON GRID LINE IMAGE         PLOT0125
       TIX *-2,2,1                                                      PLOT0126
       STZ I            I = 0, COLUMN INDEX FOR VERTICAL GRID POSITIONS PLOT0127
GAMMA  TSX PLACE,4      PLACE I FOR VERTICAL GRID LINE IN NON GRID IMAGEPLOT0128
       TXH IEYE                                                         PLOT0129
       TXH I                                                            PLOT0130
       TXH BLANK                                                        PLOT0131
       TSX PLACE,4      PLACE + AT INTERSECTION POINTS IN GRID LINE IMAGPLOT0132
       TXH IPLUS                                                        PLOT0133
       TXH I                                                            PLOT0134
       TXH DASH                                                         PLOT0135
       CLA I                                                            PLOT0136
       ADD SBV                                                          PLOT0137
       STO I            I=I+SBV, INCREMENT COLUMN INDEX FOR VERT GRID   PLOT0138
       SUB TOTAL                                                        PLOT0139
       TZE GAMMA        IF ZERO OR MINUS LINE IS UNFINISHED, RETURN     PLOT0140
       TMI GAMMA                                                        PLOT0141
DELTA  CLA **           NSCALE, DETERMINES SCALE FACTOR MODIFICATION    PLOT0142
       TZE ETA          STANDARD SCALE FACTORS AND DEC POINT POSITIONS  PLOT0143
       LXD FOUR,4       G3 = NSCALE-1       SCALE FACTOR FOR Y          PLOT0144
DELT   CLA **,4         G4 = NSCALE-2       DEC POINT POSITION FOR Y    PLOT0145
       TSX TFIX,2       G5 = NSCALE-3       SCALE FACTOR FOR X          PLOT0146
       STO G3+1,4       G7 = NSCALE-4       DEC POINT POSITION FOR X    PLOT0147
       TIX DELT,4,1                                                     PLOT0148
ETA    CLA G4                                                           PLOT0149
       TZE *+4                                                          PLOT0150
       TPL *+3                                                          PLOT0151
       CLS ONE          NEG DEC POINT POSITION, INTEGER ORDINATE DESIREDPLOT0152
TWNTY  TXL *+4,0,COL/6                                                  PLOT0153
       LRS 35                                                           PLOT0154
       CLA EIGHT        MAX DEC PLACES FOR ORDINATE IS EIGHT            PLOT0155
       TLQ PASS3                                                        PLOT0156
       STO G4           WHENEVER G4 .G. 8, G4 = 8                       PLOT0157
PASS3  CLA G7                                                           PLOT0158
       SUB TEN          ABSCISSA DEC POINT POSITION TAKEN MODULO TEN    PLOT0159
       TPL *-1                                                          PLOT0160
       ADD TEN                                                          PLOT0161
       TZE *+3                                                          PLOT0162
       TPL *+2                                                          PLOT0163
       CLS ONE          NEG DEC POINT POSITION, INTEGER ABSCISSA DESIREDPLOT0164
       STO G7                                                           PLOT0165
       CLA SBV          SBV, COLUMNS AVAILABLE FOR EACH ABSCISSA VALUE  PLOT0166
       SUB ONE          LEAVE ONE BLANK TO SEPARATE NUMBERS             PLOT0167
       STO G9           G9 = SBV-1     FIELD WIDTH FOR ABSCISSA VALUES  PLOT0168
       LDQ G7           WHENEVER G7.GE.G9, G7 = G9-1                    PLOT0169
       TLQ PASS4        INSURES DECIMAL POINT INSIDE FIELD              PLOT0170
       SUB ONE                                                          PLOT0171
       STO G7                                                           PLOT0172
PASS4  CLA TWELV        TWELVE SPACES ON LEFT FOR ORDINATE AND LABEL    PLOT0173
       ADD G7                                                           PLOT0174
       STO G6           G6 = G7+12     FIELD WIDTH, LEFT ABSCISSA VALUE PLOT0175
       CLA RECLT                                                        PLOT0176
       SUB TOTAL                                                        PLOT0177
       SUB G6                                                           PLOT0178
       TPL *+3          WHENEVER RECLT-TOTAL-G6.L.0, MUST REDUCE G6     PLOT0179
       ADD G6                                                           PLOT0180
       STO G6           G6  REDUCED TO NUMBER OF COLUMNS AVAILABLE      PLOT0181
PASS5  CLA G6           WHENEVER G7.GE.G6, G7 = G6-1                    PLOT0182
       LDQ G7           INSURES DECIMAL POINT INSIDE LEFTMOST FIELD     PLOT0183
       TLQ EXIT-1                                                       PLOT0184
       SUB ONE                                                          PLOT0185
       STO G7                                                           PLOT0186
       LXD IR4,4        RESTORE REGISTERS                               PLOT0187
EXIT   PXD 0,0          RETURN ZERO, SUCCESSFUL PLOT1,PLOT2,PLOT3,PLOT4 PLOT0188
       LXD IR1,1                                                        PLOT0189
       LXD IR2,2                                                        PLOT0190
       TRA 6,4                                                          PLOT0191
       REM .............................................................PLOT0192
       REM         MAIN JOB OF PLOT2 IS TO REPEATEDLY LAY DOWN SAMPLE   PLOT0193
       REM         GRIDLINE (DASH TO DASH-WORDS+1) FOLLOWED BY (SBH-1)  PLOT0194
       REM         NON-GRID LINES (BLANK TO BLANK-WORDS+1) TO FORM THE  PLOT0195
       REM         GRID IN THE IMAGE REGION                             PLOT0196
PLOT2  SXD IR4,4        ENTRY TO PLOT2                                  PLOT0197
       SXD IR2,2        SAVE REGISTERS                                  PLOT0198
       SXD IR1,1                                                        PLOT0199
       CLA PLADD        PREPARE SWITCH FOR EXIT FROM TSTFP              PLOT0200
       COM                                                              PLOT0201
       STD SAVE4-1           PLOT3 ADD COMPLEMENT IN DEC OF TSTFP EXIT  PLOT0202
       STZ WRON3        WRON3 = 0      CLEAR ERROR FLAG, MISSING PLOT2  PLOT0203
       CLA WRON1                                                        PLOT0204
       TZE *+3                                                          PLOT0205
       CLA FPTWO        WRON1 ERROR FLAG SET, UNSUCCESSFUL PLOT1        PLOT0206
       TRA 6,4          RETURN TWO, UNSUCCESSFUL PLOT2                  PLOT0207
       CLA 1,4          ADDRESS OF THE IMAGE REGION                     PLOT0208
       STA PLT22                                                        PLOT0209
       STA PLT23                                                        PLOT0210
       STA PLT37                                                        PLOT0211
       STA ADDB                                                         PLOT0212
       STZ WRON2        WRON2 = 0      CLEAR ERROR FLAG, PLOT2          PLOT0213
       CLA 2,4                                                          PLOT0214
       STA *+1                                                          PLOT0215
       CLA **           XMAX, MAXIMUM ABSCISSA (X) VALUE                PLOT0216
       TSX TSTFP,2      TEST FOR FLOATING POINT ARGUMENT                PLOT0217
       STO XMAX                                                         PLOT0218
       CLA 3,4                                                          PLOT0219
       STA *+1                                                          PLOT0220
       CLA **           XMIN, MINIMUM ABSCISSA (X) VALUE                PLOT0221
       TSX TSTFP,2      TEST FOR FLOATING POINT ARGUMENT                PLOT0222
       STO XMIN                                                         PLOT0223
       CLA 4,4                                                          PLOT0224
       STA *+1                                                          PLOT0225
       CLA **           YMAX, MAXIMUM ORDINATE (Y) VALUE                PLOT0226
       TSX TSTFP,2      TEST FOR FLOATING POINT ARGUMENT                PLOT0227
       STO YMAX                                                         PLOT0228
       CLA 5,4                                                          PLOT0229
       STA *+1                                                          PLOT0230
       CLA **           YMIN, MINIMUM ORDINATE (Y) VALUE                PLOT0231
       TSX TSTFP,2      TEST FOR FLOATING POINT ARGUMENT                PLOT0232
       STO YMIN                                                         PLOT0233
       CLS XMIN                                                         PLOT0234
       FAD XMAX                                                         PLOT0235
       TMI BAD          WHENEVER XMIN .GE. XMAX, ERROR RETURN           PLOT0236
       STO SPANX        SPANX = XMAX - XMIN      ABSCISSA SPAN          PLOT0237
       CLS YMIN                                                         PLOT0238
       FAD YMAX                                                         PLOT0239
       TMI BAD          WHENEVER YMIN .GE. YMAX, ERROR RETURN           PLOT0240
       STO SPANY        SPANY = YMAX - YMIN      ORDINATE SPAN          PLOT0241
       CLA LINES                                                        PLOT0242
       TSX FLOAT,2                                                      PLOT0243
       FDP SPANY                                                        PLOT0244
       STQ U            U = LINES/SPANY     NUMBER OF LINES PER UNIT Y  PLOT0245
       CLA TOT                                                          PLOT0246
       TSX FLOAT,2                                                      PLOT0247
       FDP SPANX                                                        PLOT0248
       STQ V            V = TOT/SPANX       NUMBER OF COLUMNS PER UNIT XPLOT0249
       CLA NV                                                           PLOT0250
       TSX FLOAT,2                                                      PLOT0251
       STO TEMP                                                         PLOT0252
       CLA SPANX                                                        PLOT0253
       FDP TEMP                                                         PLOT0254
       STQ DELTX        DETLX = SPANX/NV    X INCR BETWN VERT GRID LINESPLOT0255
       CLA NH                                                           PLOT0256
       TSX FLOAT,2                                                      PLOT0257
       STO TEMP                                                         PLOT0258
       CLA SPANY                                                        PLOT0259
       FDP TEMP                                                         PLOT0260
       STQ DELTY        DELTY = SPANY/NH    Y INCR BETWN HORZ GRID LINESPLOT0261
       STZ I            I=0  INITIALIZE WORD COUNTER FOR IMAGE REGION   PLOT0262
       STZ J            J=0  INITIALIZE LINE COUNTER FOR IMAGE REGION   PLOT0263
TNEXT  STZ K            K=0  INITIALIZE WORD COUNTER FOR HORZ GRID LINE PLOT0264
LNEXT  CLA K            LOOP FROM LNEXT TO NEXT PLACES ONE HORIZONTAL   PLOT0265
       PAX 0,2          GRID LINE IMAGE (DASH REGION) INTO IMAGE REGION PLOT0266
       ADD I                                                            PLOT0267
       PAX 0,4                                                          PLOT0268
       CLA DASH,2                                                       PLOT0269
PLT22  STO **,4                                                         PLOT0270
       CLA K                                                            PLOT0271
       ADD ONE                                                          PLOT0272
       STO K            K = K+1        INCREMENT WORD COUNTER FOR LINE  PLOT0273
       SUB WORDS                                                        PLOT0274
NEXT   TNZ LNEXT        IF NONZERO, LINE IS UNFINISHED                  PLOT0275
       CLA I                                                            PLOT0276
       ADD WORDS                                                        PLOT0277
       STO I            I = I+WORDS    INCR WORD COUNTER FOR NEW LINE   PLOT0278
       CLA NH                                                           PLOT0279
       SUB J                                                            PLOT0280
       TZE EXIT-1       WHENEVER J.E.NH, IMAGE GRID COMPLETED           PLOT0281
       CLA ONE                                                          PLOT0282
       STO TEMP         TEMP = 1  INITIALIZE BETWEEN GRID LINE COUNTER  PLOT0283
TFIN   STZ K            K=0  INITIALIZE WORD COUNTER FOR EACH LINE      PLOT0284
LFIN   CLA K            LOOP FROM TFIN TO FNSH PLACES SBH NON GRID LINE PLOT0285
       PAX 0,2          IMAGES (BLANK REGION) INTO THE IMAGE REGION     PLOT0286
       ADD I                                                            PLOT0287
       PAX 0,4                                                          PLOT0288
       CLA BLANK,2                                                      PLOT0289
PLT23  STO **,4                                                         PLOT0290
       CLA K                                                            PLOT0291
       ADD ONE                                                          PLOT0292
       STO K            K = K+1        INCREMENT WORD COUNTER FOR LINE  PLOT0293
       SUB WORDS                                                        PLOT0294
FIN    TNZ LFIN         IF NONZERO, LINE IS UNFINISHED                  PLOT0295
       CLA I                                                            PLOT0296
       ADD WORDS                                                        PLOT0297
       STO I            I = I+WORDS    INCR WORD COUNTER FOR NEW LINE   PLOT0298
       CLA TEMP                                                         PLOT0299
       ADD ONE                                                          PLOT0300
       STO TEMP         TEMP = TEMP+1  INCREMENT BETWN GRID LINE COUNTERPLOT0301
       SUB SBH                                                          PLOT0302
FNSH   TNZ TFIN         IF NONZERO, MORE NON GRID LINES ARE REQUIRED    PLOT0303
       CLA J                                                            PLOT0304
       ADD ONE                                                          PLOT0305
       STO J            J = J+1   INCREMENT LINE COUNT FOR IMAGE REGION PLOT0306
NTEEN  TXL TNEXT,0,COL/6-1   RETURN FOR ANOTHER HORIZONTAL GRID LINE    PLOT0307
BAD    CLA FPTWO        RETURN TWO, UNSUCCESSFUL PLOT2                  PLOT0308
       STO WRON2        SET ERROR FLAG, PLOT2                           PLOT0309
       WTD OTAPE   .....                                                PLOT0310
       CPY ER2     .....WRITE COMMENT  PLOT2                            PLOT0311
WRITE  CPY WRONG   .....WRITE COMMENT  IMPROPER ARGUMENT                PLOT0312
       CPY WRONG+1 .....                                                PLOT0313
       CPY WRONG+2 .....                                                PLOT0314
       IOD         .....                                                PLOT0315
INDX1  TXL EXIT+1,0,**                                                  PLOT0316
ERR3   WTD OTAPE   .....                                                PLOT0317
       CPY ER3     .....WRITE COMMENT  NO PREVIOUS PLOT2                PLOT0318
       CPY ER3+1   .....                                                PLOT0319
       CPY ER3+2   .....                                                PLOT0320
       IOD         .....                                                PLOT0321
       TXL EXIT+1,0,    RETURN, REGISTER 4 UNCHANGED                    PLOT0322
       REM .............................................................PLOT0323
       REM         PLOT3 EXAMINES THE DATA POINT TO MAKE SURE IT IS     PLOT0324
       REM         FLOATING POINT AND THEN PLACES IT IN THE PROPER SPOT PLOT0325
       REM         IN THE IMAGE REGION                                  PLOT0326
PLOT3  SXD IR4,4        ENTRY TO PLOT3                                  PLOT0327
       SXD IR2,2        SAVE REGISTERS                                  PLOT0328
       SXD IR1,1                                                        PLOT0329
       STZ FLAG1        FLAG1 = 0      PLOT3 RETURN PRESET TO ZERO      PLOT0330
       CLA 1,4          BCD, ADDRESS OF THE PLOTTING CHARACTER          PLOT0331
       STA PLT36                                                        PLOT0332
       CLA 2,4          X,   BASE ADDRESS FOR X COORDINATES             PLOT0333
       STA PLT35                                                        PLOT0334
       CLA 3,4          Y,   BASE ADDRESS OF THE Y COORDINATES          PLOT0335
       STA PLT34                                                        PLOT0336
       CLA WRON1                                                        PLOT0337
       ORA WRON2                                                        PLOT0338
       TZE *+3                                                          PLOT0339
       CLA FTHRE        WRON1 OR WRON2 ERROR FLAG SET,BAD PLOT1 OR PLOT2PLOT0340
       TRA 5,4          RETURN THREE, UNSUCCESSFUL PLOT3                PLOT0341
       ORA WRON3                                                        PLOT0342
       TZE *+3                                                          PLOT0343
       CLA FTHRE        WRON3 ERROR FLAG SET, NO PREVIOUS PLOT2         PLOT0344
       TXI ERR3,4,1     RETURN THREE, UNSUCCESSFUL PLOT3                PLOT0345
       CLA 4,4                                                          PLOT0346
       STA *+1                                                          PLOT0347
       CLA **           NDATA, NUMBER OF DATA POINTS TO BE PLOTTED      PLOT0348
       TSX FIX,2                                                        PLOT0349
       TNZ *+3                                                          PLOT0350
       CLS FTHRE        IF NDATA = 0, NO DATA POINTS. RETURN MINUS THREEPLOT0351
       TRA 5,4                                                          PLOT0352
       STO NDATA                                                        PLOT0353
       STZ K            K=0       INITIALIZE DATA POINT COUNTER         PLOT0354
LTEND  LXA K,1                                                          PLOT0355
PLT34  CLS **,1         Y(K)      Y COORDINATE OF (K+1)TH DATA POINT    PLOT0356
       TSX TSTFP,2      TEST FOR FLOATING POINT ARGUMENT                PLOT0357
       FAD YMAX                                                         PLOT0358
       LRS 35                                                           PLOT0359
       FMP U                                                            PLOT0360
       TPL *+3                                                          PLOT0361
       FSB N05                                                          PLOT0362
       TXL *+2,0,                                                       PLOT0363
       FAD N05                                                          PLOT0364
       TSX FIX1,2                                                       PLOT0365
       STO I            I=(YMAX-Y(K))*U +OR- 0.5, LINE INDEX FOR DATA PTPLOT0366
       TZE *+5          Y COORDINATE LIES ON TOP GRID LINE              PLOT0367
       TMI THEND-2      REJECT POINT, LIES ABOVE TOP GRID LINE          PLOT0368
       SUB LINES                                                        PLOT0369
       TZE *+2          Y COORDINATE LIES ON BOTTOM GRID LINE           PLOT0370
       TPL THEND-2      REJECT POINT, LIES BELOW BOTTOM GRID LINE       PLOT0371
PLT35  CLA **,1         X(K)      X COORDINATE OF (K+1)TH DATA POINT    PLOT0372
       TSX TSTFP,2      TEST FOR FLOATING POINT ARGUMENT                PLOT0373
       FSB XMIN                                                         PLOT0374
       LRS 35                                                           PLOT0375
       FMP V                                                            PLOT0376
       TPL *+3                                                          PLOT0377
       FSB N05                                                          PLOT0378
PLADD  TXL *+2,0,PLOT3       (ADDRESS OF PLOT3 IN DECREMENT)            PLOT0379
       FAD N05                                                          PLOT0380
       TSX FIX1,2                                                       PLOT0381
       STO J            J=(X(K)-XMIN)*V +OR- 0.5, COL INDEX FOR DATA PT PLOT0382
       TZE *+5          X COORDINATE LIES ON LEFTMOST GRID LINE         PLOT0383
       TMI THEND-2      REJECT POINT, LIES TO LEFT OF LEFTMOST GRID LINEPLOT0384
       SUB TOT                                                          PLOT0385
       TZE *+2          X COORDINATE LIES ON RIGHTMOST GRID LINE        PLOT0386
       TPL THEND-2      REJECT POINT, LIES TO RIGHT OF RIGHT GRID LINE  PLOT0387
       LDQ TOTLS                                                        PLOT0388
       MPY I                                                            PLOT0389
       LLS 35                                                           PLOT0390
       ADD J                                                            PLOT0391
       STO L            L=TOTLS*I+J, CHARACTER POSITION IN IMAGE REGION PLOT0392
       TSX PLACE,4      PLACES PLOTTING CHARACTER BCD IN THE L TH       PLOT0393
PLT36  TXH **           CHARACTER POSITION OF THE IMAGE REGION          PLOT0394
       TXH L                                                            PLOT0395
PLT37  TXH **,0,-1                                                      PLOT0396
FOUR   TXL *+3,0,4                                                      PLOT0397
       CLS FTHRE                                                        PLOT0398
       STO FLAG1        FLAG1=-3, PLOT3 RETURN SET FOR REJECTED POINT   PLOT0399
THEND  CLA K                                                            PLOT0400
       ADD ONE                                                          PLOT0401
       STO K            K=K+1     INCREMENT DATA POINT COUNTER          PLOT0402
       SUB NDATA                                                        PLOT0403
       TNZ LTEND        IF NONZERO, MORE DATA POINTS TO BE PLOTTED      PLOT0404
       CLA FLAG1        PLOT3 RETURN                                    PLOT0405
