       STO CHAR         ACCUMULATOR                                     PLOT0817
ALRIT  CLA BOOL         WHEN BOOL = 0, SOME NON-BLANK CHAR HAS ALREADY  PLOT0818
       TZE STLST        BEEN PLACED, SO CHAR MUST BE PLACED EVEN IF 0   PLOT0819
       CLA CHAR         WHEN CHAR = 0 (AND NO NON-BLANK CHAR HAS BEEN   PLOT0820
