       SUB ONE                                                          PLOT0826
       STO TEMP                                                         PLOT0827
       TSX PLACE,4      PLACE LEADING SIGN IN TYPEWHEEL COUNT-1         PLOT0828
       TXH SIGN                                                         PLOT0829
       TXH TEMP                                                         PLOT0830
       TXH REG                                                          PLOT0831
STATC  STZ BOOL         NON-BLANK CHAR HAS BEEN PLACED  BOOL = 0        PLOT0832
