       RQL 30                LEFT ADJUSTED BCD CHARACTER                PLOT0834
       STQ TEMP                                                         PLOT0835
       TSX PLACE,4      PLACE CHAR IN TYPEBAR COUNT                     PLOT0836
       TXH TEMP                                                         PLOT0837
       TXH COUNT                                                        PLOT0838
